Hypothesis generated
  HYP-2227: number-theory tournaments are local-witness carrier quotients.
  They give morale progress by turning impossible global claims into finite
  side-channel ledgers: what is the vertex set, what edge observable is kept,
  and which quotient would destroy the obstruction?
